title: One change of a CRLF file (line 2) and the one of a file with tabs are staged, the appended CRLF line stays unstaged; index must hold 'SECOND line\r' and the tabbed line, bytes on disk untouched
folders: odd-files
expect-file: odd-files/crlf.txt :: ^first line\r\nSECOND line\r\nthird line\r\nfourth line\r\n$
expect-file: odd-files/tabs.go :: \t\tprintln\("tabs changed"\)\n
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 4000
left changes
goto crlf.txt
wait 1200
part stage crlf.txt 2
wait 1500
mark crlf
wait 600
part stage tabs.go 5
wait 1500
goto tabs.go
wait 1200
mark tabs
wait 600
quit
